        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/wet/scene_rat_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6d6e3356-f225-4290-ba2d-97fd3c2c14de).Image",
        "Description": "This is a typical Monday. You wake up and go to work early in the morning - same LEDs, same skull logos, same computers and walls. The second you leave your working place, your boss puts you on duty in the kitchen outside the facility. Why? That&apos;s not even your main job!\rOh, and the rain falls. You hate rain.\r\rYou are tired and you understand - you deserve more. A little time will pass before you understand - you are hungry.\rThe blood awaits, and it&apos;s time to pay a friendly visit.",
